.SS "enum \fBSystemEx\&.AI\&.ModelMeta\fP : int"

.PP
Defines strongly typed metadata keys for model execution\&. Naming follows the AI_META_XXX convention, Values are grouped logically and designed to remain stable for long-term API usage\&.

.PP
These metadata keys describe backend information, model details, request/response properties, execution metrics, tool usage, and error diagnostics\&. 
.PP
